SUMMARY:[Municipal Government] Kelowna Inaugural Council Meeting & Swearing
 -In (2026–2030)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Municipal Government\n\nJudge Clarke Burnett administ
 ers the Oath of Office to Mayor Tom Dyas and Councillors Les Bellamy\, Kev
 in Kraft\, Davis Kyle\, Gord Lovegrove\, Brady Rogers\, Mohini Singh\, Lau
 ra Thurnheer and Rick Webber. One-hour ceremony followed by a public coffe
 e and appetizer reception until 9 p.m. Open to the public\; livestreamed a
 t kelowna.ca/council. Good networking opportunity with the new council.\n\
 nSource / more info: https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/municipal-news/city-
 of-kelowna/new-kelowna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
LOCATION:Mary Irwin Theatre\, Rotary Centre for the Arts\, 421 Cawston Ave\
 , Kelowna\, BC
CATEGORIES:Municipal Government
URL:https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/municipal-news/city-of-kelowna/new-kel
 owna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
