SUMMARY:[Municipal Government] West Kelowna Inaugural Council Meeting + Fir
 st Regular Meeting
DESCRIPTION:Category: Municipal Government\n\nAcclaimed Mayor Stephen Johns
 ton and Councillors Justin Chapman\, Tasha Da Silva\, Rick de Jong\, Tom G
 roat\, Garrett Millsap and Chris Moyer are sworn in\, followed by the firs
 t regular council meeting. Expect appointments to the RDCO board. Public w
 elcome\; webcast at westkelownacity.ca/webcasts. In Dan Albas's riding.\n\
 nSource / more info: https://kelownacapnews.com/2026/11/02/central-okanaga
 n-city-councils-set-to-be-sworn-in/
LOCATION:West Kelowna City Hall Council Chambers\, 3731 Old Okanagan Hwy\, 
 West Kelowna\, BC
CATEGORIES:Municipal Government
URL:https://kelownacapnews.com/2026/11/02/central-okanagan-city-councils-se
 t-to-be-sworn-in/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
