SUMMARY:[Indigenous & First Nations] Indigenous Veterans Day (Westbank Firs
 t Nation ceremony: date TBC)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Indigenous & First Nations\n\nNational Indigenous Vet
 erans Day. Westbank First Nation\, which sits in the heart of the riding\,
  holds a public ceremony at its cenotaph every year\; in 2025 it was held 
 the Friday before (Nov 7\, 10:30 a.m.–noon\, lunch to follow). Nov 8 202
 6 is a Sunday\, so check wfn.ca for this year's date. Chief\, council and 
 local elected officials usually attend.\n\nSource / more info: https://wfn
 .ca/blog/Indigenous-Veterans-Day.htm
LOCATION:WFN Cenotaph\, 1900 Quail Lane\, Westbank\, BC
CATEGORIES:Indigenous & First Nations
URL:https://wfn.ca/blog/Indigenous-Veterans-Day.htm
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
