SUMMARY:[Municipal Government] Kelowna City Council: First Regular Meeting 
 of New Term
DESCRIPTION:Category: Municipal Government\n\nFirst regular meeting of the 
 2026–2030 council. Kelowna's regular public meetings are Mondays at 1:30
  p.m.\; council also meets Monday mornings at 9 a.m. for policy and in-cam
 era business. Livestreamed at kelowna.ca/council. Check the agenda for the
  exact times.\n\nSource / more info: https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/muni
 cipal-news/city-of-kelowna/new-kelowna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
LOCATION:Council Chamber\, Kelowna City Hall\, 1435 Water Street\, Kelowna\
 , BC
CATEGORIES:Municipal Government
URL:https://www.am1150.ca/90986/news/municipal-news/city-of-kelowna/new-kel
 owna-city-council-to-be-sworn-in/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
