DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:[Business & Economic Policy] Trade Diversification: Where Do We Sta
 nd? (Sara Wilshaw\, Chief Trade Commissioner)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Business & Economic Policy\n\nA three-hour in-person 
 session led by Sara Wilshaw\, Canada's Chief Trade Commissioner\, with the
  Kelowna Chamber\, on diversifying into EU and Indo-Pacific markets. Highl
 y relevant to federal trade policy and government relations. The start tim
 e wasn't published\; registration closes Nov 5.\n\nSource / more info: htt
 ps://www.tradecommissioner.gc.ca/en/trade-events-training/2026/11/trade-di
 versification-where-do-we-stand.html
LOCATION:Kelowna Innovation Centre (Theatre)\, 460 Doyle Avenue\, Kelowna\,
  BC
CATEGORIES:Business & Economic Policy
URL:https://www.tradecommissioner.gc.ca/en/trade-events-training/2026/11/tr
 ade-diversification-where-do-we-stand.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
