SUMMARY:[Ceremonies & Commemorations] Remembrance Day: Summerland
DESCRIPTION:Category: Ceremonies & Commemorations\n\nParade of Legion membe
 rs\, veterans and the Summerland Pipe Band leaves Wharton St at 10:30 a.m.
  and marches to the Memorial Park cenotaph\; two minutes of silence at 11.
  The Legion (14205 Rosedale Ave) opens at noon. Times are based on past ye
 ars.\n\nSource / more info: https://infonews.ca/?p=2466565
LOCATION:Memorial Park\, Wharton Street\, Summerland\, BC
