SUMMARY:[Ceremonies & Commemorations] Remembrance Day: Kelowna (Legion Bran
 ch #26)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Ceremonies & Commemorations\n\nThe region's largest c
 eremony: a parade from Bernard Ave & Water St to the City Park cenotaph\, 
 organized by Royal Canadian Legion Kelowna Branch #26. Elected officials l
 ay wreaths. Times are based on past years\; confirm closer to the date.\n\
 nSource / more info: https://infonews.ca/?p=2466565
