SUMMARY:[Charity & Fundraisers] 35th Innkeeper's Gala: 'A Diamond Affair' (
 Hotel Eldorado 100th)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Charity & Fundraisers\n\nBilled as Kelowna's top char
 itable event\; more than 350 guests and usually sells out. Proceeds go to 
 Okanagan College's Centre for Food\, Wine and Tourism and Kelowna General 
 Hospital (including JoeAnna's House). A VIP 'Elevated Prelude' runs before
  the gala. Business and civic leaders attend. Tickets on Eventbrite.\n\nSo
 urce / more info: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/35th-annual-innkeepers-gala-
 tickets-2002479432889
LOCATION:Hotel Eldorado\, 500 Cook Rd\, Kelowna\, BC
CATEGORIES:Charity & Fundraisers
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/35th-annual-innkeepers-gala-tickets-2002479
 432889
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
