SUMMARY:[Regional Government] RDCO Inaugural Regular Board Meeting (new boa
 rd\, chair election)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Regional Government\n\nFirst meeting of the new Regio
 nal District of Central Okanagan board after the election\; the chair and 
 vice-chair are elected. Directors come from Kelowna\, West Kelowna\, Peach
 land\, Lake Country and the electoral areas\, with Westbank First Nation a
 s a non-voting member. Streamed at rdco.com/board.\n\nSource / more info: 
 https://www.rdco.com/media/dpqi2yjt/2026-board-and-committee-schedule.pdf
LOCATION:RDCO Woodhaven Boardroom\, 1450 KLO Rd\, Kelowna\, BC
